<title>FINLAND: Sisu Oy to sell German unit Stama to Chiron-Werke.</title>
<headline>Sisu Oy to sell German unit Stama to Chiron-Werke.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish heavy vehicles manufacturer Oy Sisu Ab said on Monday it had sealed a deal to sell its German subsidiary Stama Maschinenfabrik GmbH to Chiron-Werke GmbH &amp; Co KG for an undisclosed sum.</p>
<p>&quot;The transaction has no effect on Sisu's results,&quot; Sisu said in a statement.</p>
</text>
